# Lane BE-3 work log (append-only) — integration/auth host

Scope: auditE-core #1 — the entire provider-login pipeline is absent
(`integration.list` → `[]`, oauth routes → errors, wellknown add → always-400,
no IntegrationService in oc-core). This lane lands the host.

## Phase 1 — v2 integration surface inventory (citations)

### Service shape (packages/core/src/integration.ts, 834 L)
- Interface `Integration.Interface` (integration.ts:157-233): `get/list`,
  `connection.{active,resolve,key,activate,update,remove,status}`, `oauth.{connect,status,complete,cancel}`,
  `command.{connect,status,cancel}`, `revision()`, `transform` (editor).
- Registry semantics (integration.ts:293-356): entries = `{ref:{id,name,metadata?}, methods[], implementations:Map<methodID,OAuthImpl>}`;
  `editor.method.update` dedupes by (type, id) for oauth/command, by type for key/env;
  every transform notifies ephemeral `integration.updated` (schema/integration.ts:57-60; bus publish integration.ts:355).
- Attempt lifecycle (integration.ts:237-260): 10-min attempt lifetime, 1-min terminal
  retention, 30-s scrub loop (integration.ts:509-556); pending → (complete|failed|expired);
  `persisting`/`completing` flags guard double-claim (integration.ts:408-461, 762-784).
- Connections (integration.ts:369-383): stored credentials reversed (newest first —
  db orders `asc(active), asc(created), asc(id)` and `.toReversed()`), then env connections
  for every env-method name present in `process.env`.
- `connection.resolve` (integration.ts:696-714): env → `Credential.Key` from env var;
  credential → if oauth + implementation.refresh + `expires <= now+5min` → refresh + update row.
- OAuth connect (integration.ts:558-608): validate form answer (Form.validateFields/validateAnswer),
  run `authorize(answer)` → `OAuthAuthorization{url,instructions,expiresAt?,mode:auto|code,callback}`
  (integration.ts:57-70); mode auto → fork callback, settle on exit; mode code → complete(code)
  drives `callback(code)`. `CodeRequiredError` (integration.ts:109-111) when code missing.
- Command connect (integration.ts:610-674): spawn `method.command` (extendEnv, stdin ignore),
  stderr appended to attempt message (visible while pending), exit!=0 → fail with trimmed stderr,
  stdout.trim() → `Credential.Key`; empty → fail.
- Credential auto-label (integration.ts:358-367): `name`, `name 2`, `name 3`… first free label.

### Credential model (packages/core/src/credential.ts, 325 L)
- Table `credential` (id, integration_id, label, value JSON, active, time_created);
  Value = `{type:"oauth", methodID, refresh, access, expires, metadata?}` |
  `{type:"key", key, metadata?, configuration?}` (schema/credential.ts:29-47).
- create (credential.ts:105-168): activate unless `activate===false && existing`;
  publishes global `credential.updated` always + `credential.switched` when activated.
- activate (169-204): picked-active = `desc(active), desc(created), desc(id)`; no-op if same;
  publishes `credential.switched`.
- remove (255-320): replacement pick `desc(created), desc(id)`; publishes
  `credential.updated` + `credential.switched {credentialID: replacement|null}`.
- update (205-254): label change → `credential.updated` only.

### HTTP surface (protocol groups/integration.ts; server handlers/integration.ts)
- 11 ops: list, get, wellknown.add (204; 400 kind `well_known_discovery` on failure),
  connect.key (204), oauth.connect (Attempt), oauth.status (AttemptStatus),
  oauth.complete (204; CodeRequired → 400 kind `integration_code_required`;
  AuthorizationError → 400 kind `integration_authorization`), oauth.cancel (204),
  command.connect (CommandAttempt), command.status, command.cancel.
- 404s: `IntegrationNotFoundError`, `IntegrationAttemptNotFoundError`,
  `IntegrationMethodNotFoundError` (command connect only).
- Wire shapes: Attempt `{attemptID,url,instructions,mode,time:{created,expires}}`;
  AttemptStatus tag-union on `status`; CommandAttempt `{attemptID,time}`;
  Info `{id,name,methods[],connections[]}`; connection union tag `type`
  (credential: `{type,id,label,method:key|oauth,status?}`; env: `{type,name,status?}`).

### Auth kinds registered in v2 (plugin space)
- Catalog-wide (plugin/models-dev.ts:33-52): every models.dev provider with
  `environment.length>0` gets `{type:"key"}` + `{type:"env",names:environmentNames(provider)}`
  (azure filter `_API_KEY` + AZURE_COGNITIVE_SERVICES_API_KEY, models-dev.ts:77-84).
- zen / OpenCode Console (plugin/provider/opencode.ts:88-165): integration `opencode`,
  method `device` (form: hidden `server` default `https://opencode.ai/console`),
  clientID `opencode-cli`; `POST {server}/auth/device/code` `{client_id, supports_org_scope:true}` →
  poll `{server}/auth/device/token`; mode auto; instructions `Enter code: {user_code}`;
  refresh = same endpoint `grant_type=refresh_token` (invalid_grant → SignedOut);
  label from metadata.orgName; plus key method "API key (service account)" (:239-240).
- GitHub Copilot (plugin/provider/github-copilot.ts:13-176): integration `github-copilot`,
  method `device`; clientID `Ov23li8tweQw6odWQebz`, scope `read:user`;
  device endpoints `https://github.com/login/device/code` + `/login/oauth/access_token`
  (oauthURLs(domain) — enterprise domain support);
  entitlement check `https://api.github.com/copilot_internal/user` (chat_enabled);
  credential access=refresh=token, expires 0, metadata {enterpriseUrl?, apiEndpoint?};
  key method REMOVED (:213); no refresh (token re-polled by transport).
- xAI (plugin/provider/xai.ts:11-101): integration `xai`, method `device`
  "SuperGrok Subscription"; issuer `https://auth.x.ai/oauth2`, device grant,
  scope `openid profile email offline_access grok-cli:access api:access`, referrer `opencode`;
  refresh via `/token` grant_type=refresh_token; key method "Manually enter API Key" (:95-96).
- DigitalOcean (plugin/provider/digitalocean.ts:19-118): method `browser`, implicit flow,
  fixed port 1456, callback `/auth/callback`, browser page POSTs token to `/auth/token`,
  authorize `https://cloud.digitalocean.com/v1/oauth/authorize` scope `genai:read inference:query`.
- Poe (plugin/provider/poe.ts:20-125): method `browser`, code+PKCE (S256) loopback
  127.0.0.1:0 `/callback`, authorize `https://poe.com/oauth/authorize` scope `apikey:create`,
  exchange `https://api.poe.com/token`; refresh = expiry check only (keys valid till expiry).
- Others in v2 not ported this lane (deferred): chatgpt browser/headless token-sharing,
  azure Entra CLI, gitlab, snowflake external-browser, openai codex variants.
- WellKnown (core/wellknown.ts): manifest `{auth:{command[],env},config?,remote_config?}` at
  `{origin}/.well-known/opencode`; sources persisted in KV `wellknown:sources`;
  command-auth integrations spawn `manifest.auth.command` (CommandMethod).

### Rust side before this lane
- Routes exist but stub: misc.rs:161-264 (list → [], get → 404, wellknown → 400 always,
  oauth/command → 404s / 400s).
- Credential table + handlers complete (handlers/credential.rs; events wired BE-1).
- oc-cli `auth list/login/logout/export/import` exists (890 L) against oc-client —
  dead-ends at the stubbed routes.
- Engine exposes `db`, `bus`, `catalog_service` (engine/mod.rs:323-331) — host hangs off these.

## Phase 2 — oc-core integration host (WIP, green)

- `integration::types` — v2 wire shapes: Method/ConnectionInfo/Info/Attempt/
  AttemptStatus/CommandAttempt(Status) tag-unions (camelCase), CredentialValue
  (oauth|key), typed `IntegrationError` (CodeRequired/Authorization/AttemptNotFound/
  MethodNotFound) (types.rs).
- `integration::credential::CredentialStore` — the v2 credential.ts port over the
  shared `credential` table: all/list/get/create/activate/update/remove with the
  exact picked-active ordering (`desc(active),desc(created),desc(id)`), replacement
  promotion on remove, legacy-NULL pinning, and global `credential.updated` /
  `credential.switched` publishes (credential.rs).
- `integration::IntegrationHost` — registry (update_integration/update_method/
  remove_method with v2 slot-dedupe), list/get projections (credential rows
  newest-first + env connections), connection active/resolve (refresh when
  `expires <= now+5min`), connect_key (form validation + label derivation
  `name`, `name 2`, …), connection_status projection + `integration.updated`
  notify, OAuth attempts (10-min lifetime, auto-fork settle, complete/cancel,
  CodeRequired, persisting guard), command attempts (spawn, stderr → message,
  stdout → key), 30-s scrub (mod.rs).
- `integration::flows` — PKCE S256, state nonces, device-code request/poll
  engine (pending/slow_down, +3s margins), loopback callback listener (HTTP/1.1
  on tokio; bootstrap POST-back page for implicit flows, success page for code
  redirects) (flows.rs).
- `integration::providers` — built-ins 1:1 with v2: catalog-wide key/env
  methods incl. the azure `_API_KEY` filter; OpenCode Console (zen) device flow
  + refresh + orgName label; GitHub Copilot device flow (clientID Ov23li8tweQw6odWQebz,
  enterprise form, entitlement check, key method removed); xAI device + refresh;
  DigitalOcean implicit (port 1456 bootstrap page); Poe code+PKCE (providers.rs).
- Engine boots `pub integration: Arc<IntegrationHost>`; bus registry gained
  `integration.updated` (append-only).
- Tests (13, all green): registry projections, env connections, store
  activation+events, key-label derivation, code/auto attempt lifecycles,
  failure messages, command sourcing (success+failure), refresh-on-resolve
  (persisted), zen device round-trip against a local mock (request shapes
  asserted), loopback listener params/HTML, v2 wire serialization.
- cargo fmt + clippy (pedantic) clean; oc-core nextest 795/795.

## Phase 3 — server routes + CLI end-to-end (WIP, green)

- `oc-server/handlers/integration.rs` (new): the 11 integration operations
  over `engine.integration` with v2's exact error mapping — Authorization →
  400 `integration_authorization`, CodeRequired → 400 `integration_code_required`,
  wellknown failures → 400 `well_known_discovery`, Integration/Attempt/Method
  404 tagged envelopes. Stubs removed from misc.rs (routes + handlers);
  module merged in handlers/mod.rs (route table stays 141 — coverage test green).
- `wellknown.add`: fetches `{url}/.well-known/opencode`, requires
  `auth.command`, persists the origin union in kv `wellknown:sources`,
  registers the integration (name = hostname, command method `login`) and
  publishes `integration.updated` (wellknown.ts:113-148 + wellknown/plugin.ts).
  Persisted sources re-register at first `integration.list`
  (`AppState.wellknown_restore` OnceLock; the WellKnownPlugin boot transform).
- `integration.get` is location-wrapped (v2 `Location.response`) — caught by
  the client decode in tests.
- Tests (`oc-server/tests/be3_lane.rs`, 5 green): list/get round-trip incl.
  404 envelope; connect.key → stored connection + `credential.updated` /
  `credential.switched` on the SSE stream; the zen device flow THROUGH the
  real routes against a mock IdP (attempt shape, poll → complete, orgName
  label, mock request-shape assertions: client_id/supports_org_scope/device
  grant); wellknown add (400 no-auth → registered command integration →
  sourced key credential); code-required 400 envelope (`kind` via spread fields).
- CLI e2e (`oc-cli/tests/auth_e2e.rs`, green): spawns the real `opencode serve`
  binary, `auth list` (empty) → `auth login opencode --method device --answer
  server=<mock>` (auto flow → "Connected to OpenCode Console") → `auth list`
  (credential `org_e2e`) → `auth logout opencode org_e2e` → empty again.
- cargo fmt + clippy (pedantic) clean on oc-core/oc-server/oc-cli;
  nextest 1184/1184 across the three crates.

Divergences (deliberate, logged): v2 `Effect.die` paths (complete on an
already-completing attempt, oauth connect with unknown method) surface as
400 `integration_authorization` instead of 500 UnknownError — typed
instead of defect; wellknown `config`/`remote_config` resolution into the
provider config graph is the config lane's surface (route + registration land
here; resolution deferred).

