  tests; bare domains keep v2's `https://api.{domain}` mapping.
- Mock harness upgraded: path-prefix routing, per-response status codes,
  shared request log (no more eprintln-only captures).
- New round-trips (oc-core integration::tests, 17 total green):
  - `copilot_device_flow_round_trip_against_mock` — device request shape
    (client_id Ov23li8tweQw6odWQebz, scope read:user, device grant),
    entitlement probe, credential shape (access == refresh, expires 0,
    metadata enterpriseUrl + apiEndpoint honored from
    `endpoints.api` with trailing-slash trim).
  - `copilot_entitlement_denial_fails_the_attempt` — `chat_enabled: false`
